    <h1>QA Process Setup for Series A Startups: What to Build and When</h1>
    <p class="post-hero-lead">At Series A, you are shipping faster than your test coverage can keep up with. The QA process you build in the next 90 days will either scale with you or become the ceiling on how fast you can ship.</p>
